      "section": "grammar",
      "prompt": "まいにち にほんご ___ べんきょうします。",
      "options": [
        "は",
        "が",
        "を",
        "に"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "を (wo) marks the direct object. The thing you eat, study, buy, or do goes before を.\nりんごをたべます。→ I eat an apple.",
